# Tracked on purpose. It holds only NEXT_PUBLIC_* values, which `next build`
# compiles into the browser bundle and are therefore public already — and the
# build needs them from the repository, since a value set in a hosting
# dashboard is bound after the bundle has been compiled and cannot be inlined.
